Vyp wrote:
> Carrying 2 luckstones is better than carrying only one or is the same?

Carrying two luckstones of different blessed/uncursed/cursed status will
affect each other WRT its +/- luck effect. Don't carry cursed luckstones
in open inventory, but carried in a bag they won't influence your luck.

It is sufficient to carry a single uncursed luckstone. If that one gets
cursed occasionally it's good to have a spare one in your bag (or have
some means to uncurse it).

A blessed luckstone is only advantageous if you stupidly managed to get
your luck down beyond recognition.

